# Config (contains secrets)
# Leading **/ so this also catches the copies under loxone2hue/src and
# homeassistant/loxone2hue/src — a plain "configs/config.yaml" is anchored to
# the repository root and let the live config through into both add-on trees.
**/configs/config.yaml
# Backups carry the HUE application key and the Miniserver passwords
**/configs/backups/
.env

